                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, BWANA asema hivi, katika habari ya Yehoyakimu, mwana wa Yosia, mfalme wa Yuda; Hawatamwombolezea, wakisema, Aa! Ndugu yangu; au, Aa! Dada yangu; wala hawatamlilia, wakisema, Aa! Bwana wangu; au, Aa! Utukufu wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
